        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saz",
          "text": "Most Denver police reports are available within three to seven business days after filing.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bb2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sb1",
          "text": "Police reports may support insurance claims by documenting the circumstances of the crash and possible fault.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bb6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sb3",
          "text": "After a car accident, a police report can play an important role in supporting an insurance claim and documenting the circumstances of the crash. Knowing how to ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sb4",
          "text": "file a police report in Denver",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sb5",
          "text": " and obtain a copy of the report can help you protect your rights and prepare for the next steps.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bbd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lba",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-car-accident-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sb7",
          "text": "At ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sb8",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sb9",
          "text": ", our",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbb",
          "text": " Denver car accident lawyers",
          "marks": [
            "lba",
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbc",
          "text": " guide injured clients through every stage of the claims process, including obtaining and using police reports as valuable evidence. Understanding how these reports work and where to request them can make it much easier to navigate your case.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bbf",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbe",
          "text": "Where to Get a Copy of Your Police Report in Denver",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bbh",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbg",
          "text": "Anyone involved in an accident within city limits has a few reliable options for obtaining a copy of their report, each with its own process and turnaround time.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bbj",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbi",
          "text": "Denver Police Department Records Unit",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bbl",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbk",
          "text": "The Records Unit is where you can obtain a copy of your police report in Denver. If your accident occurred within Denver city limits, this is generally the first place to start. Police reports are typically available in person, online, or by mail.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bbn",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbm",
          "text": "Colorado Open Records Act Guidelines",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bbs",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lbp",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://publicsafety.colorado.gov/colorado-open-records-request"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbo",
          "text": "Thanks to the Colorado Open Records Act (CORA), you can request public records through state-approved channels. According to the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbq",
          "text": "Department of Public Safety",
          "marks": [
            "lbp"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbr",
          "text": ", the first hour of research and retrieval is free, but there may be a nominal charge of $0.25 per page for physical copies. Requests can be expedited if made via their online form or email.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bbu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbt",
          "text": "For the fastest possible processing, ensure you have key details ready before beginning your request. Typically, this includes your personal identification, the specific date and time of the incident, and the police report number.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bbw",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbv",
          "text": "How to Request Police Records in Denver",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bby",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbx",
          "text": "Once your report is available, you have several options for requesting a copy from the Denver Police Department. Whether you prefer the convenience of an online request, mailing in your application, or visiting the Records Unit in person, choosing the right method depends on your needs. The following are the most common ways to obtain a police report in Denver.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc0",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbz",
          "text": "1. Submit an Online Request",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc1",
          "text": "Denver Police have online forms to request reports. Visit the Denver government website and follow the instructions for obtaining a copy of a police report.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc4",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc3",
          "text": "2. Mail-In Requests",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc5",
          "text": "If you want your records in paper form, requests via mail will be honored. Where applicable, an applicable fee, along with any required identification and report details, should be included.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bc8",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc7",
          "text": "3. In-Person at the Records Unit",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bca",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc9",
          "text": "You can also go directly to the Records Unit of the Denver Police Department for a faster way to get your report. This might allow you to collect documents on the same day. You should call in advance to confirm their operating hours and procedures.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bcc",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scb",
          "text": "4. Third-Party Platforms",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bce",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scd",
          "text": "A few reports are retrievable through third-party vendors licensed by the Denver Police Department. Be more considerate of those services and ensure they do not conflict with the official procedures.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bcg",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scf",
          "text": "How to File a Police Report in Colorado for Non-Emergency Incidents",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bck",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sch",
          "text": "Knowing how to ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sci",
          "text": "file a police report in Denver",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scj",
          "text": " is important when you’re involved in a non-emergency accident and law enforcement does not respond to the scene. Depending on the circumstances, you may be able to report the incident online, by phone, or in person.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bcm",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scl",
          "text": "Can I File a Police Report Online in Denver?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bco",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scn",
          "text": "Yes, Denver’s online reporting system is available for certain non-emergency incidents that occur within city limits. Eligible reports generally involve no injuries, no known suspect, no stolen vehicles, and no ongoing criminal activity.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bct",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lcq",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://mydmv.colorado.gov/_/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scp",
          "text": "To file online, visit the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scr",
          "text": "Denver Police Department’s website",
          "marks": [
            "lcq"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scs",
          "text": ", select the appropriate incident, and complete the report with as much detail as possible. If an officer did not respond to a minor traffic accident, you may also need to file a crash report with the Colorado DMV for documentation purposes.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bcv",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scu",
          "text": "Can I File a Police Report in Denver on the Phone?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bcx",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scw",
          "text": "If your situation does not qualify for online reporting, call the Denver Police Department’s non-emergency line at (720) 913-2000, available 24 hours a day. Have the following information ready before calling:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bcz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scy",
          "text": "Date and time of the incident",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bd1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sd0",
          "text": "Exact location",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bd3",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sd2",
          "text": "Brief description of what happened",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bd5",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sd4",
          "text": "Names and contact information of those involved, if available",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bd7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sd6",
          "text": "Insurance information for traffic accidents",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bd9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sd8",
          "text": "If the incident is an emergency or involves injuries, call 911 immediately.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdb",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sda",
          "text": "Can I Walk into a Police Department to File a Report?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sdc",
          "text": "Yes, you can file a report in person at any Denver Police District Station or at Police Headquarters, located at 1331 Cherokee Street, Denver, CO 80204. This option is helpful if you need to provide supporting documents or evidence.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdf",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sde",
          "text": "Bring the following if available:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdh",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sdg",
          "text": "Driver’s license",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sdi",
          "text": "Vehicle registration",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdl",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sdk",
          "text": "Proof of insurance",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sdm",
          "text": "Other driver’s contact and insurance information",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sdo",
          "text": "Photos, witness information, or other evidence related to the incident",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdr",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sdq",
          "text": "Filing your report promptly helps create an official record and may support future insurance or legal claims.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "ids",
      "src": "./images/2025-07-file-a-police-report-denver-1-1.jpg",
      "alt": "file a police report denver"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdu",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sdt",
          "text": "Types of Crimes You Can Report Via the Internet in Denver",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sdv",
          "text": "Denver’s online system accepts a defined list of non-violent, no-suspect incidents, and a few apply directly to car accidents. Eligible categories generally include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bdy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sdx",
          "text": "Hit-and-run accidents where the at-fault driver fled the scene and is not known",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "be0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sdz",
          "text": "Theft from a vehicle, such as a stolen catalytic converter or items taken from inside a parked car",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "be2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "se1",
          "text": "Vandalism to a vehicle with no identified suspect",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "be4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "se3",
          "text": "Vehicle-related fraud, such as unauthorized use of financial information following an accident",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "be6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "se5",
          "text": "Lost property connected to a vehicle incident",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "be8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "se7",
          "text": "Accidents involving injury, a suspect still on scene, a stolen vehicle, or a driver under the influence cannot be filed online under any circumstance. These situations require immediate officer involvement and evidence collection, making a phone call or an in-person report the appropriate course of action.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bea",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "se9",
          "text": "How Long Does It Take To Get a Police Report in Denver?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bef",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lec",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://content.leg.colorado.gov/sites/default/files/colorado_open_records_act_cora_-_colorado_law_summary.pdf"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "seb",
          "text": "Most police reports in Denver are available within three to seven business days after the incident is filed. Under the",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sed",
          "text": " Colorado Open Records Act",
          "marks": [
            "lec"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "see",
          "text": ", the custodian of records must generally make a report available within three business days, with a seven-day extension allowed for large or complex requests. Online reports may take a bit longer to appear in the system if the incident requires review before an officer assigns it. Following up directly with the records unit is often the fastest way to check on a report’s status.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "beh",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "seg",
          "text": "Common Types of Car Accidents in Denver",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bem",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lej",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://codot.gov/safety/distracteddriving"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sei",
          "text": "Knowing the specifics of your car accident is essential when filing reports or claims. According to ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sek",
          "text": "Colorado Department of Transportation data",
          "marks": [
            "lej"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sel",
          "text": ", the most common scenarios involve the following:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bep",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sen",
          "text": "Rear-End Collisions:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "seo",
          "text": " These are among the most common accidents and usually occur when drivers are distracted. In Colorado, distracted driving caused more than 10,000 car crashes in the year 2020 alone.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bes",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "seq",
          "text": "Single-Vehicle Accidents:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "ser",
          "text": " Sometimes, accidents involving obstructions and overspeeding result in single-vehicle collisions, which greatly increase the likelihood of property damage.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bev",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "set",
          "text": "Multi-Vehicle Pile-Ups: ",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "seu",
          "text": "These are common on highways, where multiple drivers may be involved, leading to complicated liability claims.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bex",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sew",
          "text": "Regardless of the type of accident, obtaining a copy of the police report can help document the circumstances of the crash and support your insurance claim or legal case.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bf2",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lez",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/car-accident-statistics-in-denver-colorado-2025/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sey",
          "text": "Understanding ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sf0",
          "text": "Car Accident",
          "marks": [
            "lez"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sf1",
          "text": " Liability",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bf4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sf3",
          "text": "The ability to determine liability is crucial for recovering compensation following an accident. Colorado follows the comparative negligence rule, which basically provides that one driver’s responsibility in the accident would preclude recovery of damages.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bf9",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lf6",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/what-to-do-after-a-car-accident-in-colorado/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sf5",
          "text": "For instance, if a distracted driver caused your accident, you may need to consider their negligence. Police reports may detail witness statements, weather conditions, and officer observations that may show fault. Knowing ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sf7",
          "text": "what to do after a car accident",
          "marks": [
            "lf6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sf8",
          "text": " in Colorado, including how to preserve that evidence, helps protect your claim from the start.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bfb",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sfa",
          "text": "If liability is not clear or you’re unsure about how fault applies in your case, it may be wise to consult an attorney specializing in car accident law.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bfd",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sfc",
          "text": "Reasons to Speak with a Denver Car Accident Attorney",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bff",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sfe",
          "text": "The consequences of a car accident can be overwhelming, from filing reports and handling insurance claims to covering medical expenses. The process can quickly become complicated, especially when you are recovering from injuries. You may also face challenges gathering evidence, identifying witnesses, or negotiating with insurance companies that prioritize minimizing payouts. An experienced car accident lawyer can guide you through every step of the process, protect your rights, and pursue the compensation you deserve.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bfh",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sfg",
          "text": "Benefits of Working with an Attorney",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bfj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sfi",
          "text": "Working with an experienced car accident lawyer can help protect your rights and make the claims process easier. Some of the key benefits include:",
          "marks": []
