      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sfm",
          "text": "An ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sfo",
          "text": "experienced car accident attorney",
          "marks": [
            "lfn"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sfp",
          "text": " can go over each detail of your case with you, from the police reports and eyewitness statements to the actual evidence. A full assessment provides a clear understanding of your situation and may offer an outlook on how your case will be processed, potential outcomes, and the best possible strategy to consider throughout the process.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bfs",
      "style": "h4",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sfr",
          "text": "Maximum Compensation Securing",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bfu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sft",
          "text": "A lawyer considers every avenue of potential compensation, from medical expenses and lost wages to property damage and emotional distress. They gather evidence, consult experts, and document your losses so that nothing is overlooked. They fight for the compensation you deserve so you can start recovering and moving forward.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bfw",
      "style": "h4",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sfv",
          "text": "Navigating Insurance Claims",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bfy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sfx",
          "text": "It is really stressful to have to deal with insurance companies, especially when they try to minimize or deny payouts. An experienced attorney handles such challenges, negotiating and protecting your rights to fair compensation. They handle the details so you can focus on healing.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
